<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><%- include("../partials/head") %><title>Seller registration | Goan Craving</title>
<style>
.seller-wrap{max-width:620px;margin:100px auto 60px;padding:20px}.seller-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #eadfce;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(22px,5vw,40px);box-shadow:0 14px 45px #49301912}.seller-card h1{color:#17552b;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,5vw,2.5rem);margin:0 0 8px}.seller-card p{color:#6f675c;line-height:1.6}.seller-field{margin:20px 0}.seller-field label{display:block;font-weight:750;margin-bottom:7px}.seller-field input,.seller-field textarea{width:100%;padding:13px;border:1px solid #e5d8c7;border-radius:12px;font:inherit}.seller-field textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:95px}.seller-submit{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:#f36b35;color:white;padding:14px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.seller-error{background:#fff0ed;color:#a32c1b;padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
</style></head><body><%- include("../partials/nave") %>
<main class="seller-wrap"><section class="seller-card"><div style="font-size:2rem">🌴</div><h1>Become a Goan Craving seller</h1><p>Set up your seller profile first. You can add your food photos, descriptions and prices from your dashboard.</p>
<% if(error){ %><div class="seller-error" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>
<form method="post" action="/seller/register">
<div class="seller-field"><label for="fullName">Full name</label><input id="fullName" name="fullName" value="<%= user.sellerProfile?.fullName || user.fullName || '' %>" minlength="2" maxlength="100" required autocomplete="name"></div>
<div class="seller-field"><label for="showName">Seller / shop display name</label><input id="showName" name="showName" value="<%= user.sellerProfile?.showName || '' %>" minlength="2" maxlength="80" placeholder="Example: Auntie’s Goan Kitchen" required></div>
<div class="seller-field"><label for="restaurantName">Restaurant name</label><input id="restaurantName" name="restaurantName" value="<%= user.sellerProfile?.restaurantName || '' %>" minlength="2" maxlength="120" placeholder="Name customers will see" required autocomplete="organization"></div>
<div class="seller-field"><label for="restaurantAddress">Restaurant address</label><textarea id="restaurantAddress" name="restaurantAddress" maxlength="500" placeholder="Building, street, area, city, state and PIN code" required><%= user.sellerProfile?.restaurantAddress || '' %></textarea></div>
<div class="seller-field"><label for="latitude">Restaurant map pin — latitude</label><input id="latitude" name="latitude" type="number" min="-90" max="90" step="any" value="<%= user.sellerProfile?.restaurantLocation?.latitude ?? '' %>" placeholder="Example: 15.12345" required></div>
<div class="seller-field"><label for="longitude">Restaurant map pin — longitude</label><input id="longitude" name="longitude" type="number" min="-180" max="180" step="any" value="<%= user.sellerProfile?.restaurantLocation?.longitude ?? '' %>" placeholder="Example: 73.98765" required></div>
<p>Use the coordinates of the restaurant itself (for example, from its pin in Google Maps), not your current phone location unless you are at the restaurant.</p>
<button class="seller-submit" type="submit">Save restaurant and open dashboard</button>
</form></section></main><%- include("../partials/scripts") %></body></html>
